    <h2>Dairy Queen Chicken Strip Baskets — Complete 2026 Guide</h2>
    <p>The Dairy Queen Chicken Strip Basket is one of the most satisfying meals on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>. Every basket includes 100% whole white-meat chicken strips, hand-battered and crispy-fried, served with seasoned fries, Texas toast, and your choice of dipping sauce. The 4-Piece at $9.99 is the standard meal for one; the 6-Piece at $13.49 is for larger appetites or sharing.</p>
